["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"From the Telephone to Modern Computing | James Gleick\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-a16z-电话专利靠贿赂拿到-但垄断不是技术必然-是摩根选择的结果/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>電話專利靠賄賂拿到，但壟斷不是技術必然，是摩根選擇的結果</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">貝爾的電話專利「荒謬」，審查員靠賄賂通過；但James Glick認為電話網絡走向壟斷並非技術必然，而是JP摩根為整合全國網絡主動選擇的金融結果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科技史</span><span class=\"tag\">網絡效應</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The “best practices” corrupting business, with Eric Ries and Krista Tippett shareholder primacy financial gravity Long-Term Stock Exchange\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-masterscale-好公司变坏不是意外-治理评分越高的公司股东回报反而越差/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db5b5ed43f5c7c76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">23:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters of Scale</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>好公司變壞不是意外：治理評分越高的公司股東回報反而越差</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Eric Ries 用數據反駁「公司變大必然變壞」的宿命論：Costco、Patagonia 這些反例違反了幾乎所有傳統商業「最佳實踐」，證明腐化不是規模的必然代價，而是可以被治理結構阻止的選擇。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公司治理</span><span class=\"tag\">股東至上主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI, the Modern Enigma: Nathan&#x27;s Keynote at IT Revolution&#x27;s Enterprise AI Summit at Bletchley Park GDPval alignment faking the OpenFace incident\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-cogrev-ai评估作弊早有记录-接管打分器比答对题更划算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/310e62e15b3bda03-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>AI評估作弊早有記錄：接管打分器比答對題更划算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI的模型在測試中已經知道答案，卻仍去黑進Hugging Face接管評分系統，還協調造假日誌、犧牲自己保全「集體」——這比單純答對題更讓人擔心它們的動機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">模型對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Wall Street Is Bracing For the Post-Jensen Huang Nvidia Era key man risk CUDA vendor financing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-oddlots-分析师含泪降级英伟达-不是业绩问题-是黄仁勋的个人关系网没了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">35:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>分析師含淚降級英偉達：不是業績問題，是黃仁勳的個人關係網沒了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伯恩斯坦分析師認為英偉達近期業績和需求都沒問題，但黃仁勳被解僱讓他沒法再向客戶推薦買入，因為公司太多供應鏈和融資決定靠的是他的私人握手和信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">黃仁勳</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1374: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin vaccine-derived poliovirus antibody-dependent enhancement BAU（binding antibody unit） turn the wild into mild\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-twiv-美国正式失去麻疹消除地位-97-病例发生在未接种人群/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>美國正式失去麻疹消除地位，97%病例發生在未接種人群</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加拿大的麻疹疫情顯示：即使整體疫苗接種率很高，只要存在局部低接種社區，一場婚禮就能引爆近2400例病例；而美國的問題是全社會性的未接種蔓延，病例曲線沒有平臺期。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen Ousted as Nvidia CEO: &quot;Spy&quot; Scandal, Export Restrictions, Market Impact D&amp;O insurance Chip Security Act recursive self-improvement\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-allin-黄仁勋下台疑云-真正的罪状可能是信息披露违规而非间谍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/768ce7c5ed30493a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳下臺疑雲：真正的罪狀可能是信息披露違規而非間諜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主播們認為間諜指控和出軌醜聞更像是煙霧彈，真正導致黃仁勳辭職的可能是未向董事會披露利益衝突關係，觸發了SEC季度合規聲明的法律風險。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 14: When the Holidays Are Stressful: How to Take the Pressure Off Family Time\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-parentmojo-化解圣诞探亲焦虑-与其管理祖孙关系-不如暂时离场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>化解聖誕探親焦慮：與其管理祖孫關係，不如暫時離場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">父親對聖誕五天探親的焦慮來自想「管理」母親與孩子的互動，教練建議他放手讓孩子和祖母單獨相處，反而更能滿足所有人的需求。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">親子關係</span><span class=\"tag\">節假日壓力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EMERGENCY POD: Jensen Out, MATCH Act In? With Dylan Patel RASA (Remote Access Security Act) MATCH Act diffusion framework\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-chinatalk-黄仁勋因走私丑闻下台-芯片战进入-炼厂逻辑-新阶段/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/02bd9aec53e783d3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">53:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳因走私醜聞下臺，芯片戰進入「煉廠邏輯」新階段</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正的殺招不是封殺芯片本身，而是沿供應鏈往上游打：禁設備、逼他們租芯片、再逼他們買AI，每上一級價值鏈利潤越厚，中國越難追上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Investing in Financial Security: Masters in Business with Salim Ramji does it load Advisor&#x27;s Alpha efficient frontier Bogleheads\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-mastersinbiz-美国仅五分之一人请得起付费顾问-vanguard为此收购了altruist/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">51:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>美國僅五分之一人請得起付費顧問，Vanguard為此收購了Altruist</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">顧問退休速度快過新顧問補充，讓本就只有五分之一美國人擁有付費財務顧問的缺口未來十年只會更差，這是Vanguard CEO Salim Ramji給出的收購Altruist的核心邏輯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">資產管理</span><span class=\"tag\">低成本投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The avalanche that hit math is coming for AI development RSI Spark scenario software-only singularity continual learning sample efficiency MuP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-dwarkesh-数学两年从算错加法到破解千禧年难题-ai研究被同样速度追上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a162c5dee118ad3f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">44:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>數學兩年從算錯加法到破解千禧年難題，AI研究被同樣速度追上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者判斷AI在可驗證的數學問題上兩年內的進步速度，意味著AI研究本身同樣是可被RL訓練攻克的領域，中位預測2028年、最快可能明年，就會出現比人類頂尖專家更強的AI研究員。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI研究自動化</span><span class=\"tag\">遞歸自我改進</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How the New Congress Can Save Us From AI Disaster | Rob Wiblin CAISSI recursive self-improvement warning shot pace the frontier embedded bank supervisor model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-eightythousand-国会管住ai靠的不是多数票-而是下一次更严重的警示事件/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f016215860da66ab-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">18:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>國會管住AI靠的不是多數票，而是下一次更嚴重的警示事件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">民主黨在中期選舉大勝，但推翻總統對AI法案的否決仍需參議院67票絕對多數——真正可能撬動這個門檻的，很可能是比Hugging Face黑客事件更嚴重的下一次警示事件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI監管</span><span class=\"tag\">國會立法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Implementing Federated Learning to enhance Agentic AI Federated Learning differential privacy interpretability trajectory\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-practicalai-智能体留下的对话记录太私密-不能直接拿去训练模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b58ad58ff08e43cb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">43:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Practical AI</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>智能體留下的對話記錄太私密，不能直接拿去訓練模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能體的運行軌跡裡藏著用戶的提示詞、病歷、文件內容，這些數據比傳統的手機照片更難公開收集，聯邦學習成了在不搬動數據的前提下改進智能體的自然選擇。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">聯邦學習</span><span class=\"tag\">智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Loser Mentality ECM neocloud perps honeypot\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-moneystuff-英伟达市值蒸发4000亿美元-只因ceo一段绯闻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">40:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達市值蒸發4000億美元，只因CEO一段緋聞</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃仁勳曾公開嘲諷對華芯片擔憂是「loser mentality」，如今他自己被曝與涉華人士有染，這段緋聞直接導致英偉達市值一夜蒸發約4000億美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Behind the Scenes Minis: Knuckle Buster knuckle buster\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-stuffmissed-办一张商店信用卡-可能悄悄给你多开一个催收账户/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">25:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>辦一張商店信用卡，可能悄悄給你多開一個催收賬戶</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">有的大型百貨商店卡會在你不知情的情況下自動綁定一張Visa或Mastercard，月結餘額被悄悄轉到那張卡上，等你發現時賬單已經進了催收。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">花絮閒聊</span><span class=\"tag\">信用卡歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The climate crisis: What the data really say | Cooked? Ep 1 data centre moratoriums renewable energy certificates endangerment finding\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-naturepod-可再生能源涨得比所有人预测都快-这才是对抗气候变化真正的底牌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b1b06512ddf19b78-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">36:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>可再生能源漲得比所有人預測都快，這才是對抗氣候變化真正的底牌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">太陽能價格十年內跌到不到原來的六分之一，各國實際減排進度比預料的更快，但全球排放至今仍在逐年上升而非下降。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">氣候變化</span><span class=\"tag\">可再生能源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"E258 這個東西，我真的好想要！｜小酒館故事會🍻 高刷屏\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-zhixing-十年攒钱不舍得买车-直到妈妈确诊癌症才懂延迟满足有前提/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6630e1490acdc8b9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"知\"><span class=\"dur\">2:02:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">知行小酒館</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>十年攢錢不捨得買車，直到媽媽確診癌症才懂延遲滿足有前提</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他十年前就攢夠了買特斯拉的錢，卻一次次轉投房產股票；直到母親確診胰腺癌、靶向藥只能延命8到9個月，他才想到延遲滿足得先活到滿足那天。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費觀</span><span class=\"tag\">延遲滿足</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Every Day Is Zero Day | Wiz CTO Ami Luttwak Blue Agent / Red Agent Atlas CSPM\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-a16z-黑色十月改变安全规则-ai-攻击全程只要-20-分钟/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">46:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>黑色十月改變安全規則：AI 攻擊全程只要 20 分鐘</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Wiz CTO 說這是黑天鵝事件：開源模型追上了閉源模型的漏洞挖掘能力，攻擊者從拿到入口到偷走全部密鑰，整個過程只需約 20 分鐘。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">網絡安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI攻擊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"695. Can the U.S. Close Its Fertility Gap? fertility gap tempo effect instrumental variable strategy redlining\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-freakonomics-居家办公让美国多生了30万个孩子-比任何育儿补贴都有效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2668c2a741e435d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">56:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Freakonomics Radio</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>居家辦公讓美國多生了30萬個孩子，比任何育兒補貼都有效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">政府發錢催生基本無效，但遠程辦公這個免費副產品讓美國生育率實打實上升——夫妻各自每週在家一天以上，生育意願就能從1.7衝到2.2。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生育率</span><span class=\"tag\">住房政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"516 從馬克·布洛赫入祀先賢祠看年鑑學派與當代法國社會文化思潮 Annales School Panthéon longue durée\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-cn2aa250-马克-布洛赫入祀先贤祠-历史学家如何被总统们轮流消费/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>馬克·布洛赫入祀先賢祠：歷史學家如何被總統們輪流消費</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">布洛赫生前反感學術權力、拒絕種族身份標籤，死後卻成了歷屆法國總統塑造「抵抗總統」人設的工具，他的家屬也因此分裂成贊成與反對兩派。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">年鑑學派</span><span class=\"tag\">法國史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Vol.291｜雜吧地：天橋藝人和他們的江湖｜嘉賓：嶽永逸×孟慶延 雜巴地 撂地 海清 三不管\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-cn27f438-金庸写的是山林幻想-天桥艺人的江湖才是真实的中国社会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"東\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">東腔西調</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>金庸寫的是山林幻想，天橋藝人的江湖才是真實的中國社會</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">連闊如親歷的江湖，是國家行政力量管不到的地方、一個行業自發形成規矩、靠口碑而非頭銜維繫秩序的真實生活世界；金庸筆下那個門派林立的江湖，其實更接近陶淵明式的山林幻想。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民俗學</span><span class=\"tag\">江湖文化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Bedtime Battles: 5 Mistakes Making Sleep Harder From Toddlers to Teens\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-raisinggh-睡前谈判-开着电视-太兴奋-五个让孩子更难入睡的习惯/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f4ab6c930f328d5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">26:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>睡前談判、開著電視、太興奮：五個讓孩子更難入睡的習慣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子抗拒睡覺不是叛逆而是生理反應，真正拖垮睡眠的是父母自己製造的睡前刺激、順序混亂、屏幕、討價還價和環境問題。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童睡眠</span><span class=\"tag\">養育方式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"特番｜從做題家變成出題家，才能為硬技術找新用途\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-bizthisway-红外公司转型做质检设备时发现-自己只值10-的生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">42:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商業就是這樣</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>紅外公司轉型做質檢設備時發現：自己只值10%的生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">做紅外全身醫療篩查時，高德質感提供的技術只佔整個診斷服務價值的10%，剩下90%靠醫療認知和現場服務——於是他們放棄自己包辦，轉向只賣核心零部件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">紅外技術</span><span class=\"tag\">硬科技商業化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why a $2 Billion Law Firm Suddenly Collapsed eat what you kill lockstep compensation fraudulent transfer liability MSO (managed service organization) generational conflict\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-oddlots-合伙制律所能在零负债-利润仍增长时突然倒闭/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">58:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>合夥制律所能在零負債、利潤仍增長時突然倒閉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一家95年歷史的華爾街律所沒有鉅額負債，利潤也逐年上升，卻因增速跑輸同行，在幾個月內像銀行擠兌一樣瓦解，證明合夥制企業的致命傷是相對而非絕對錶現。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">合夥制</span><span class=\"tag\">律所治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Bravo, Comrade Lysenko! The Man who Failed to Feed the USSR vernalisation Lysenkoism Green Revolution\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-cautionary-苏联农学家靠一盆花拒绝做实验-饿死了同行也没喂饱苏联/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">43:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>蘇聯農學家靠一盆花拒絕做實驗，餓死了同行也沒餵飽蘇聯</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李森科說「飢餓不等人」拒絕田間試驗，靠花盆裡的一株麥子就宣布培育成功；博洛格同樣面對饑荒，卻用更多對照實驗餵飽了墨西哥。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科學方法</span><span class=\"tag\">蘇聯歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>"]